### Key Observations for 10 wt% PolarClean Bath

The 10 wt% PolarClean bath slows solvent exchange, which typically:
- Reduces phase separation driving force → potentially higher pore fraction (more open structure) or lower modulus
- The one data point (15 wt%, 9°C bath, 250s wait): E=124 bar, PF=0.55 — lower modulus than comparable 0 wt% runs

